            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You are piloting a sea vehicle during boarding combat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You attempt to break your ship free and escape the battle. Attempt a check to pilot against a very hard DC. This is typically a Sailing Lore check against the standard DC of the vessel's level + 5 (for the very hard adjustment)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The vehicle pulls free and moves up to its Speed. It can turn normally provided it moves away from the ship it disengaged from."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The boarding combat continues."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
